    "approval_record": "Project owner approved formal deployment of revision_0003 (26 components published, 1029 and 12323 DEFERRED) in the Cursor chat of 2026-10-18 22:22 +08:00 and authorised the agent to record the approval under the Gencode V3 SOP (PipelineFlow 4.6: human review before production promotion). The agent did not originate the approval.",
    "approval_scope": "revision 3 of algebra.absolute_value_relations (keeps every revision 2 fix; existing operations stay backward compatible: the same constraints give the same matrix). Domain: (1) a whole relation side may be the constant 0 (|x+3|-2x=0); (2) weighted points accept positive rational weights and an optional order a>b for weighted_point_order statements and select_extreme_weighted_point; (3) new statement kind symbolic_distance (points as linear expressions of a parameter, exact piecewise identity check with an optional parameter range); (4) new operation evaluate_number_line_statements = the shared statement evaluator restricted to number-line kinds; (5) new operation solve_tolerance_range_application (standard-weight model value and its +/-p% normal range recovered as |x-a|<=b through recover_absolute_value_parameters). Adapter: internal division ratio written AP:BP (AP=2BP), and-joined systems typeset as a left-brace array, rational / a>b weighted-point text, symbolic distance statements, the tolerance application payload. Skill bindings: PointDivision gains evaluate_number_line_statements and select_extreme_weighted_point; Inequalities is narrowed to inequalities, parameter recovery, statements and the tolerance application."
  },
